# 溜来后端接口集（REST Client 插件：humao.rest-client）
# 用法：每条请求上方点 "Send Request"，或光标放请求里按 Ctrl+Alt+R
# token 自动串联：先跑一次「登录」，后面的 {{token}} 自动填好
#
# 内容对应 server/README.md 第六节（原来那堆 curl），额外补了行情与 K 线
# 前置：bash scripts/dev.sh up && bash scripts/dev.sh dev

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 健康检查（不需要 token）
GET {{host}}/healthz

### 登录拿 token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "demo"}

### 1）添加自选（带成本价与数量）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SH600519","cost_price":"1680.50","quantity":100}

### 2）重复添加 → Upsert 更新成本价，不报错
POST {{host}}/api/v1/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SH 600519","cost_price":"1700.00","quantity":200}

### 3）无效代码 → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"99999999"}

### 4）查询列表（涨幅榜）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/watchlist?filter=up
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5）手动刷新（触发行情拉取 + 提醒检查）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/watchlist/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7）新建提醒规则
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SH600519","stock_name":"贵州茅台","condition_type":"price_up","threshold":"1700.00","check_frequency":"close"}

### 7b）成交量异动（额外带 volume_base）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SZ300750","stock_name":"宁德时代","condition_type":"volume","threshold":"1.5","volume_base":20,"check_frequency":"realtime"}

### 8）同股票同条件重复创建 → 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SH600519","stock_name":"贵州茅台","condition_type":"price_up","threshold":"1850.00"}

### 9）非法阈值 → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SH600519","stock_name":"贵州茅台","condition_type":"pct_up","threshold":"120"}

### 10）越权改他人规则 → 404（把 id 换成别人的规则 id；token 用另一个账号的）
# @name update-other
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/alerts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"threshold":"1000.00"}

### 11）删除规则
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/alerts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 实时报价（聊天页 quote_card 的数据来源，可用来核对卡片字段）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stock/quote?code=SH600519
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 搜索股票代码（模糊联想：代码前缀 / 汉字名 / 拼音缩写）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stocks/search?q=茅台&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 首屏建议问题（热度池 + 会话去重；连点两次对比是否换票）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/quick-asks?count=4&session_id=dev-session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 建议问题点击上报（行为热度信号）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/quick-asks/click
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock_code":"SH600519","quick_ask_id":"qa_600519_0"}

### 注销账号（危险：硬删用户 + 自选 + 提醒规则 + 头像文件，不可恢复）
### 只用测试账号执行；小程序侧会先逐条删除 /agent/sessions/:sid
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/user/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

